sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant UI as Web frontend
    participant API as Backend API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    User->>UI: Checkout
    UI->>+API: POST /orders
    API->>+DB: Read inventory
    DB-->>-API: Inventory rows
    Note over API,DB: Transaction boundary
    alt Available
        API->>DB: Save order
        API->>API: Publish order event
        API-->>UI: Order confirmed
    else Sold out
        API-->>UI: Out of stock
    end
    deactivate API
    loop Until acknowledged
        UI->>User: Show result
    end
